                                "text": "1981, Lou Sullivan, personal diary, quoted in 2019, Ellis Martin, Zach Ozma (editors), We Both Laughed In Pleasure\nI was totally unprepared (my \"padding,\" my apartment) for an overnighter, but I invited him."
